(3, 3, 'OXF-WASH-2026-02', 'Emergency WASH & Cholera Prevention Response', 'WASH', 'Distribution of household water treatment chemicals, jerrycans, soap, and dignity kits to reduce waterborne epidemic risks.', 3500, '20L Jerrycan (x2), Water purification sachets (box), Laundry & Bathing Soap (8 bars)', 1.00, 'Emergency Hygiene Kit', 'Upper Nile', 'Malakal', '2026-01-15', '2026-10-31', 'Active', 1),
